        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "As upstream issue is fixed, I can no longer reproduce it *on latest Nightly* and it seems to be fixed. Apart from query message disappearing (if was shown) after resize, but that is more or less aligned with not showing message on startup. Note for future: if want to fix that, wrap `refresh`  call [here](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/05f4a49cd85a67b90328a1bcbae4d9ed2a0a417b/lua/mini/starter.lua#L1292) in`vim.schedule`. Right now this seems like an unnecessary change.",
